{"id":"singe","lemma":"singe","pos":"noun","rank":1786,"glosses":["monkey","ape","foolish or mischievous man"],"ipa":"/sɛ̃ʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/Fr-singe.ogg/Fr-singe.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"singes"},"formAudio":{"singes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-singes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"As-tu déjà vu un singe ?","en":"Have you ever seen a monkey?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"already, before"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Quelle sorte de singes sont-ce là ?","en":"What kind of monkeys are those?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"sort, kind, type"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Son ami ressemble à un singe.","en":"Her boyfriend looks like a monkey.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"to resemble","l":"ressembler"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Les singes volèrent toute la nourriture.","en":"The monkeys stole all the food.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to fly through the air","l":"voler"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"food, nourishment"}]},{"text":"Le singe descendit.","en":"The monkey came down.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to go down","l":"descendre"}]}]}